@page "/register-server"
@rendermode InteractiveServer

<PageTitle>Interactive Server - HttpClient</PageTitle>

<h1>Register a customer (server)</h1>
<p>
	<strong>Interactive Server:</strong> the same <code>RegisterCustomerForm</code> as the
	<a href="register">Interactive WebAssembly page</a>, running on the server. Its <code>CustomerAPIClient</code> is a
	typed client created by <code>IHttpClientFactory</code> and calls the API service-to-service with
	<code>Purview.ZodSharp.Http</code>: <code>PostAsJsonValidatedAsync</code> validates with the circuit's services
	(the uniqueness rule resolves the server's own registry - try
	<code>@InMemoryCustomerEmailRegistry.SeededEmail</code>), <code>ReadFromJsonAndValidateAsync</code> validates the
	response, and <code>TryReadZodValidationProblemAsync</code> reads a rejection back into ZodSharp errors.
</p>

<RegisterCustomerForm />
